            "review_title": "Review at Capital Mixology & Cuisine",
            "review_text": "RobJ2112\nLondon, United Kingdom36 contributions\n0\nCool venue with lovely staff\nApr 2023 • Couples\nWe stumbled upon this place while waiting for a table at a nearby pizzeria.\n\nThe staff are just so nice and friendly. Music was great and the venue is incredible. If it was in London it would be packed!\n\nDefinitely worth popping in. Live music too and drink prices very reasonable considering the set-up\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten April 21, 2023",
